# Environment variables

No third-party service is integrated yet. These names are reserved so the
integrations can be added later without changing application code.

Secrets must never be committed or referenced in client code. Only variables
prefixed with `VITE_` are exposed to the browser, and those must be
publishable values only.

## Client (publishable only)

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_MAPS_PUBLIC_KEY=

## Server only (never prefixed with VITE_)

SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_CONNECT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
IDENTITY_VERIFICATION_API_KEY=
AI_VISION_API_KEY=

Server values are read inside server function handlers via `process.env`,
never at module scope and never in components.
